---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import "./index.scss";
---

<Layout>
	<main>
		<h1>Good Day! 🌄</h1>
		<p>
			Welcome to the official documentation for Dravia Vemal's open source
			projects, licensed under AGPL-3.0 and MIT.
		</p>
		<h3>
			If you find this repository helpful, please consider giving it a
			star ⭐. Your support encourages ongoing development and
			improvement.
		</h3>
		<h3>
			Commercial users are invited to sponsor 💵 the respective
			repositories to get MIT version. Sponsorship enables me to
			prioritize and plan future development.
		</h3>
		<br />
		<p>
			This documentation is a work in progress 🚧🔨 as I continue to
			refine my workflow and organize resources for greater efficiency.
			Information may be distributed across the site during this process.
			For any questions or clarifications, please open a discussion in the
			project repository.
		</p>
	</main>
</Layout>
